# Behavioral Hierarchy Charts. Economic Analysis Course.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
A multimedia course in economic analysis was prepared and used in conjunction with the United States Naval Academy. (ED 043 790 and ED 043 791 are the final reports of the project evaluation and development model.) This report provides a list, by course segment, of summarized behavioral objectives for the course with their associated learning hierarchy charts. (EM 010 787 through EM 010 823 are related documents.) (SH)

